## Method and limits

No search, browsing, commands, or Prism calls were used, as instructed. The only date context available is today, 2026-10-23; there is no measurement window or calculable gap from an analysis end date to today. No data lane, corpus coverage, censoring method, or match mode can be reported. Counts, comparisons, and trend are unavailable; the broad description in the Verdict is interpretation, not a corpus finding.

